---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Privacy Policy | Attirel"
  description="How Attirel collects, stores, and protects your data — including your body measurements, account information, and analytics — and your rights to access and delete it."
>
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-article px-5 py-16">
    <h1 class="font-display text-4xl font-semibold leading-tight tracking-tight">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-smoke">Last updated: July 16, 2026</p>

    <div class="mt-8 space-y-8 leading-relaxed text-ink/85">
      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">1. Who we are</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          This Privacy Policy describes how Kelt IV Labs LLC ("Company", "we", "us") collects,
          uses, and protects your information when you use Attirel — our website at attirel.com
          and our application at attirel.ai. Kelt IV Labs LLC is the data controller for
          personal information processed through the Service. This policy explains what data
          we collect, why, how it is stored, and the rights you have over it.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">2. Measurement data</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          Attirel's core feature relies on body measurements you choose to provide — such as
          bust or chest, waist, hips, inseam, foot length and width, and optional measurements
          like calf circumference. If you create pet profiles, this also includes the pet
          measurements you enter.
        </p>
        <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-2 pl-5">
          <li><strong>Storage:</strong> measurements are stored encrypted in transit and at rest in our database (hosted on Supabase infrastructure).</li>
          <li><strong>Use:</strong> measurements are used solely to compute size recommendations and fit scores for you. They are never sold and never shared with retailers or advertisers.</li>
          <li><strong>Optionality:</strong> every measurement is optional. Providing fewer measurements reduces fit-score confidence but the app remains usable.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">3. Account data</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          When you create an account we collect your email address and authentication
          credentials (handled by our authentication provider; we never store plaintext
          passwords). Optional profile details — such as display name, gender selection for
          sizing purposes, skin tone selection for colour matching, style preferences, saved
          items, and preferred stores — are stored with your account and used only for fit
          scoring, personalization, and improving the Service.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">4. Usage data & analytics</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          We collect limited usage data — such as pages visited, features used, products viewed
          or saved, size feedback you submit, and outbound clicks to retailer sites — to improve
          recommendations and understand how the product is used. Outbound click tracking also
          supports our affiliate programs (see our
          <a href="/about/#affiliate-disclosure" class="font-semibold text-plum underline-offset-2 hover:underline">affiliate disclosure</a>).
          We use aggregate, privacy-respecting analytics on this website and do not build
          advertising profiles.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">5. Cookies</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          The website uses only essential cookies and local storage needed for the site to
          function. The app uses local storage to keep you signed in and to cache your
          preferences on your device.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">6. Sharing &amp; third parties</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          We share data only with the service providers required to run Attirel, each bound by
          their own data protection obligations:
        </p>
        <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-2 pl-5">
          <li><strong>Supabase</strong> — database hosting and authentication (stores your account data and measurements).</li>
          <li><strong>Vercel</strong> — website and application hosting.</li>
          <li><strong>Anthropic</strong> — AI processing of measurement conversations and fit explanations.</li>
          <li><strong>Affiliate networks</strong> — anonymous click referrals only. No measurement data is ever shared with retailers or affiliate networks.</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mt-3">
          We do not sell personal data. When you click through to a retailer, that retailer's
          own privacy policy governs what happens on their site.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">7. Your rights & data deletion</h2>
        <ul class="mt-2 list-disc space-y-2 pl-5">
          <li><strong>Access:</strong> you can view all measurements and profile data in the app at any time.</li>
          <li><strong>Correction:</strong> you can edit or remove any measurement or profile field in the app.</li>
          <li><strong>Deletion:</strong> you may delete individual profiles or your entire account — including all measurements — at any time in the app (Profile → Danger zone), or by emailing us. Deletion permanently removes all personal data and is completed within 30 days.</li>
          <li><strong>Export:</strong> you may request a copy of your data by contacting us.</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mt-3">
          Depending on your location, you may have additional rights under GDPR, UK GDPR, or
          CCPA/CPRA, including the right to lodge a complaint with your supervisory authority.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">8. Data retention</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          We retain your data for as long as your account is active. If your account is deleted,
          associated personal data is removed within 30 days, except where retention is legally
          required.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">9. Children</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          Attirel is not directed at children under 13, and we do not knowingly collect data
          from them. Adult account holders may store sizing profiles for their children as part
          of family shopping features.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">10. Changes & contact</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          We will post any changes to this policy on this page and update the date above.
          Questions or requests:
          <a href="mailto:privacy@attirel.com" class="font-semibold text-plum underline-offset-2 hover:underline">privacy@attirel.com</a>
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </article>
</Base>
